# Kueue CRD Version Pin — source of truth for k8s-core contract tests.
# This is the known-good upstream Kueue tag that PR contract tests run against.
# The nightly sentinel tests against the latest upstream automatically.
# When the nightly reports a newer version is available and compatible,
# bump KUEUE_TAG here so PRs are tested against the current upstream.
# To validate a new tag: KUEUE_TAG=<new> npm run kueue:check
KUEUE_TAG=v0.18.7
